# Hugging Face access token for LeafRust training notebooks / download_plantvillage.py
#
# 1. Copy this file next to the notebook:
#      cp scripts/huggingface.token.example scripts/huggingface.token
# 2. Create a token: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens  (read access is enough)
# 3. Replace the line below with your real token (starts with hf_...)
# 4. Never commit scripts/huggingface.token (gitignored)
#
# HF_TOKEN=YOUR_HF_TOKEN_HERE
